        </div>

        <h1 class="yoru-tables-hero-title">
            Restaurant Spaces
        </h1>

        <p class="yoru-tables-hero-description">
            Every table, every space. Curate the YORU dining experience.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>
<div class="yoru-hero-navigation">
